\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Tree verification and accepted-path commitment. (a) Drafting provides a candidate tree and proposal probabilities $q$. (b) Branch-local computation produces target probabilities $p$ and retains temporary state. (c) Sampling selects a materialized path (here $a,d$); recurrent replay, convolution gathering, and KV remapping publish $\mathcal  {S}(mad)$. The newly sampled token $b^*$ remains pending. One descriptor keeps logical ancestry and physical storage aligned.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{2}{Tree verification and accepted-path commitment. (a) Drafting provides a candidate tree and proposal probabilities $q$. (b) Branch-local computation produces target probabilities $p$ and retains temporary state. (c) Sampling selects a materialized path (here $a,d$); recurrent replay, convolution gathering, and KV remapping publish $\mathcal {S}(mad)$. The newly sampled token $b^*$ remains pending. One descriptor keeps logical ancestry and physical storage aligned}{figure.1}{}}
